# Teak Me to the Stars with Chains of Promathia's The Call of the Wyrmking completed: the offer 864 carries 2 as its last
# argument. A CoP mission counts as completed when it is below the current one (hasCompletedMission), so the char is put
# on the next mission, A Vessel Without a Captain (`mission Cop ... completed` writes no flag for CoP). That mission
# names only Cid in the Metalworks.
char zone=Metalworks pos=-26.3,-10,-2.6
fame Bastok 125
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain current
login
trigger Raibaht                 # the offer, 864 with option 2
finish                          # accepted
